iv) Same algebra:
 if 
\begin_inset Formula $\left\langle x,y\right\rangle =0$
\end_inset

,
 then 
\begin_inset Formula $\left\langle x,x\right\rangle \cancel{+2\left\langle x,y\right\rangle }+\left\langle y,y\right\rangle =\left\langle x,x\right\rangle \cancel{-2\left\langle y,x\right\rangle }+\left\langle y,y\right\rangle $
\end_inset

.
